<title>USA: Wall Street stocks lower at start.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks lower at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks moved lower at the opening on Wednesday, weighed by stronger-than-expected data for the first quarter Gross Domestic Product.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials  index was off 9.63 at 6952.40. The 30-year long bond off 15/32 to yield 7.02 percent.</p>
</text>
